## Prepare for data v*.* release

Full procedure: [data-release-cli/docs/data-release/README.md](https://github.com/oncokb/data-release-cli/blob/main/docs/data-release/README.md)

### Staging Setup (automated)

Only start this after the curators confirm they are ready for final review, so the data is frozen.

-   [ ] Run the [data release pipeline](https://github.com/oncokb/data-release-cli/actions/workflows/data-release.yaml) workflow
    -   [ ] `database_name` (ie `oncokb_v7_5`), `data_version` (ie `7.5`), `release_date` (`YYYY-MM-DD`)
    -   [ ] `run_map_portal` = `true` for the final release (`false` is fine for a beta refresh)
    -   [ ] `run_transcript_sync` = `true` unless transcripts should not be pushed to the transcript API
-   [ ] Import the versioned SQL dump from the `data-release-v*.*` branch of [oncokb-data](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/oncokb-data) into `oncokb-core-curation` (staging)
-   [ ] Restart `oncokb-core-curation` from [ArgoCD](https://argocd.cbioportal.org) and verify https://staging.oncokb.org
-   [ ] Run the [static file generator](https://github.com/oncokb/data-release-cli/actions/workflows/static-file-generator.yaml) workflow against `https://staging.oncokb.org` to generate the downloadable files and update annotations
-   [ ] Run `mvn test` locally and update any failing tests
-   [ ] Check all newly added genes have ensembl gene id and transcript id for both GRCh37 and GRCh38
-   [ ] Generate the release README with the curation platform History tool and replace it in both the oncokb-data and oncokb-datahub branches
-   [ ] Update News

### Release and Deployment

Checklist for deployment after the curation team approves the staging data. Deployment yaml files live in [knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment); all changes are synced through ArgoCD.

-   [ ] Update the compatibility table in [Core README.md](https://github.com/oncokb/oncokb/blob/master/README.md) with the latest versions
    -   [ ] oncokb
    -   [ ] oncokb-transcript
    -   [ ] gn-spring-boot
    -   [ ] gn-mongo
    -   [ ] genome-nexus-vep
    -   [ ] mysql
    -   [ ] redis
    -   [ ] oncokb data
-   [ ] Merge the `data-release-v*.*` branches in the private [oncokb-data repo](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/oncokb-data) and the public [oncokb-datahub repo](https://github.com/oncokb/oncokb-datahub)
-   [ ] Update release note
-   [ ] Publish the GitHub releases so the Docker images used below are built and pushed
    -   [ ] Review and publish the [oncokb draft release](https://github.com/oncokb/oncokb/releases) (publishing triggers the enterprise + no-frontend image builds, the Sentry release, and archives the `release-notes/pr-*` files)
    -   [ ] Review and publish the [oncokb-public draft release](https://github.com/oncokb/oncokb-public/releases) (publishing triggers the image build and Sentry release)
    -   [ ] Confirm the new tags appear on [mskcc/oncokb](https://hub.docker.com/r/mskcc/oncokb/tags) and [mskcc/oncokb-public](https://hub.docker.com/r/mskcc/oncokb-public/tags) before updating any deployment yaml
-   [ ] Update public site (https://www.oncokb.org)
    -   [ ] Update oncokb-transcript database and restart [oncokb-transcript](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/175678591974/clusters/oncokb-research/apps/oncokb-main/oncokb_transcript.yaml)
    -   [ ] Import the versioned database (ie `oncokb_core_v7_5`) into the public RDS
    -   [ ] Update `-Djdbc.url` and image in [oncokb-core](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/175678591974/clusters/oncokb-research/apps/oncokb-main/oncokb_core.yaml)
    -   [ ] Update [oncokb-public](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/175678591974/clusters/oncokb-research/apps/oncokb-main/oncokb_public.yaml) image
-   [ ] Update demo site (https://demo.oncokb.org)
    -   [ ] Update the `oncokb_core_demo` database
    -   [ ] Update [oncokb-core-demo](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/175678591974/clusters/oncokb-research/apps/public-access-apis/oncokb_core_demo.yaml) image
-   [ ] Update trimmed public site (https://public.api.oncokb.org)
    -   [ ] Update the `oncokb_core_public` database
    -   [ ] Update [oncokb-core-public](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/175678591974/clusters/oncokb-research/apps/public-access-apis/oncokb_core_public.yaml) image
-   [ ] Update MSK Prod site (https://www.oncokb.aws.mskcc.org)
    -   [ ] Import the versioned database (ie `oncokb_core_v7_5`) into the MSK prod RDS
    -   [ ] Update `-Djdbc.url` with the latest versioned database in [oncokb-core-cbx](https://github.com/knowledgesystems/knowledgesystems-k8s-deployment/blob/master/argocd/aws/084637913395/clusters/oncokb-production/apps/oncokb-core/oncokb_core_cbx.yaml)
